cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Mensajero LoRa: offline chat and photos with ESP32-S3, ESP32-C3 and a PC"
abstract: >-
  Off-grid messenger over LoRa (DX-LR32 / SX1262, 22 dBm) for emergencies: an ESP32-S3 sealed device, a pocket ESP32-C3 and a PC station serve the same web page over their own Wi-Fi. Reliable delivery with sequence numbers and retries, read receipts, resumable photos, collision backoff, OTA with rollback, simulator and hardware test bench.
